asr-000860
01:10:47.990 --> 01:10:48.990
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: and regulatory reform.

asr-000861
01:10:49.090 --> 01:10:50.890
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: So it will go on phases, sir.

asr-000862
01:10:51.710 --> 01:10:53.410
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: This will take time.

asr-000863
