01:11:22.010 --> 01:11:24.310
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: a lot of

asr-000879
01:11:24.310 --> 01:11:25.990
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: evaluation,

asr-000880
01:11:26.250 --> 01:11:27.630
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: the part of the electric co-ops.

asr-000881
01:11:28.030 --> 01:11:29.670
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Kasi evaluate nila yung mga linya nila,

asr-000882
01:11:29.830 --> 01:11:31.310
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: transformers nila, metro nila,

asr-000883
01:11:31.310 --> 01:11:32.050
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: lahat-lahat po.

asr-000884
01:11:32.290 --> 01:11:34.330
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Ang sistema para may improve

asr-000885
01:11:34.330 --> 01:11:36.270
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: yung flow ng electricity.

asr-000886
01:11:37.090 --> 01:11:38.770
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: So it's not just about

asr-000887
01:11:38.770 --> 01:11:39.830
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: telling them,

asr-000888
01:11:40.310 --> 01:11:41.390
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: 2% na lang kayo.

asr-000889
01:11:41.650 --> 01:11:43.970
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: We have to make them

asr-000890
01:11:43.970 --> 01:11:46.350
