Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang electric cooperative is non-profit.

asr-000930
01:12:59.790 --> 01:13:01.990
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So magkakaiba po yung treatment doon.

asr-000931
01:13:02.150 --> 01:13:04.030
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yung private po, may profit po yan.

asr-000932
01:13:04.110 --> 01:13:05.190
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But the good thing is,

asr-000933
01:13:05.550 --> 01:13:06.330
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: there is a plan,

asr-000934
01:13:06.950 --> 01:13:08.010
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: there's a timetable,

asr-000935
01:13:08.370 --> 01:13:09.910
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and we are going to do it.

