asr-000937
01:13:13.190 --> 01:13:15.150
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you, Secretary Sharon.

asr-000938
01:13:16.390 --> 01:13:17.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Ilan na lang po yung tanong ko.

asr-000939
01:13:17.990 --> 01:13:20.110
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Ito naman tungkol sa WESM.

asr-000940
01:13:20.790 --> 01:13:22.910
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Meron din recently na naiulat

asr-000941
01:13:22.910 --> 01:13:24.710
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: na mismo galing sa ERC

asr-000942
01:13:24.710 --> 01:13:27.790
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: that there was a technical flaw

asr-000943
01:13:27.790 --> 01:13:30.470
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: sa wholesale electricity spot market

asr-000944
01:13:30.470 --> 01:13:31.690
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: pricing mechanism.

asr-000945
01:13:31.690 --> 01:13:33.830
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Ang naging resulta po,

asr-000946
01:13:33.850 --> 01:13:35.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ay sumobra ang nasingil

asr-000947
01:13:35.850 --> 01:13:37.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: sa mga consumers natin,

asr-000948
01:13:37.850 --> 01:13:39.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: especially sa Visayas area.

asr-000949
01:13:39.850 --> 01:13:42.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: In fact, according to the reports,

asr-000950
01:13:42.850 --> 01:13:44.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ang masakit pa nga dito ay

asr-000951
01:13:44.850 --> 01:13:46.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: hindi nga yung refund ay hindi binalik

asr-000952
01:13:46.850 --> 01:13:48.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: sa mga consumers

asr-000953
01:13:48.850 --> 01:13:50.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: kung hindi binigay sa mga power companies.

asr-000954
01:13:50.850 --> 01:13:52.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: My first question is,

asr-000955
01:13:52.850 --> 01:13:54.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: sa ERC,

asr-000956
01:13:54.850 --> 01:13:56.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: magkano po ang eksaktong kabuhang

asr-000957
01:13:56.850 --> 01:13:58.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: overcharge sa mga consumer,

asr-000958
01:13:58.850 --> 01:14:00.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: lalo na sa Visayas grid,

asr-000959
01:14:00.850 --> 01:14:02.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: mula nung June 2021,

asr-000960
01:14:02.850 --> 01:14:05.850
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: dahil sa maling pricing model na ito ng WESM?

asr-000961
01:14:05.850 --> 01:14:07.850
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Chair Francis?

asr-000962
01:14:07.850 --> 01:14:09.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Thank you, Mr. Chairperson.

asr-000963
01:14:09.850 --> 01:14:13.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang nat-discovery po natin sa WESM,

asr-000964
01:14:13.850 --> 01:14:15.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: wala pong overcharging.

asr-000965
01:14:15.850 --> 01:14:19.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ibig sabihin po, tama yung mga inilalabas na

asr-000966
01:14:19.850 --> 01:14:21.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: locational marginal prices

asr-000967
01:14:21.850 --> 01:14:24.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ng ating market management system.

asr-000968
01:14:24.850 --> 01:14:26.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Within that market management system

asr-000969
01:14:26.850 --> 01:14:31.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ay yung tinatawag natin market optimization

asr-000970
01:14:31.850 --> 01:14:35.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: model na kung saan dinidetermina niya

asr-000971
01:14:35.850 --> 01:14:40.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ang presyo ng bawat node sa ating kabuhang grid.

asr-000972
01:14:40.850 --> 01:14:44.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At ito ang mga presyong gagabay ngayon

asr-000973
01:14:44.850 --> 01:14:47.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: doon sa mga transaksyong nangyayari sa WESM.

asr-000974
01:14:47.850 --> 01:14:50.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Tama po ang inilalabas na presyo.

asr-000975
01:14:50.850 --> 01:14:53.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero po, ang nakita natin,

asr-000976
01:14:53.850 --> 01:14:57.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: sa tuwing nagkakaroon ng binding constraint,

asr-000977
01:14:57.850 --> 01:14:59.850
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ibig sabihin, may congestion

asr-000995
01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:07.720
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: doon sa interconnection na kumukonekta ng Visayas at Mindanao o kaya naman ng Luzon at Visayas,

asr-000996
01:15:08.600 --> 01:15:13.480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: nagkakaroon ng biglang pagsipa doon sa line rental.

asr-000997
01:15:13.480 --> 01:15:19.680
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At supposedly, kapagka nagkaroon naman ng pangungulekta ng line rental,

asr-000998
01:15:20.120 --> 01:15:28.640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ito ay mapapasama doon sa bayarin ng mga distribution utilities na bumili mula sa WESEM.

asr-000999
01:15:28.640 --> 01:15:38.040
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero kung yung amount na malilikom mula sa lahat ng mga customers o yung tinatawag nating trading amount ng mga customers

asr-001000
01:15:38.040 --> 01:15:44.060
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ay sosobra doon sa pangangailangan upang mabayaran.

asr-001001
01:15:44.520 --> 01:15:51.760
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yung trading amount naman, kabuoang trading amount ng para sa generators, magkakaroon ng surplus.

asr-001002
01:15:51.760 --> 01:15:58.580
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At nandoon sa mekanismo ng WESEM, kapagka may surplus, dapat ito ay ibabalik.

asr-001003
01:15:58.640 --> 01:16:03.160
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Doon sa mayroong kontribusyon dyan sa surplus na yan.

asr-001004
01:16:03.580 --> 01:16:05.180
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Bakit nagkakaroon ng surplus?

asr-001005
01:16:05.180 --> 01:16:10.800
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Mari kong ipaliwanag lang po. Hopefully, maging mas simple.

asr-001006
01:16:12.160 --> 01:16:21.700
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang ating pong locational marginal prices sa bawat node, ito po ay binubuo ng system marginal price o ito yung palang base price.

asr-001007
01:16:22.320 --> 01:16:28.200
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At on top of the base price, ay mayroong cost.

asr-001008
01:16:28.640 --> 01:16:32.940
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Mayroong cost of line losses at saka yung cost of congestion.

asr-001009
01:16:33.640 --> 01:16:35.580
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Bakit magkakaroon ng line losses?

asr-001010
01:16:35.860 --> 01:16:40.960
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kasi mayroon ng inherent din na losses even sa ating transmission lines.

asr-001011
01:16:40.960 --> 01:16:50.620
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya kung halimbawa ang isang customer, mangangailangan ng 100 megawatt, pero mayroong 2% na nawawala sa linya,

asr-001012
01:16:51.120 --> 01:16:58.160
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ang isang generator na magsusupply dito sa customer na ito, kakailanganin kung halimbawa 2%,

asr-001013
01:16:58.640 --> 01:17:07.100
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: kakailanganin na magsusupply hindi lang ng 100 megawatt, kailangan may sobra na 102 kung 2%.

asr-001014
01:17:07.100 --> 01:17:15.880
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dahil kung kailangan niya 100 at 100 lang ang isupply ng generator, ang mangyayari niyan, kulang.

asr-001015
01:17:16.420 --> 01:17:24.600
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya mayroong kailangan siyang 2 megawatt na additional na isusupply at yung 2 megawatt na yan, may kabayaran niyan.

asr-001016
01:17:24.600 --> 01:17:28.400
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya ito ay nadadagdag doon sa locational marginal price.

asr-001017
01:17:28.640 --> 01:17:35.000
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ng node na ito, ito po ay yung isa pa lang na component, yung line loss.

asr-001018
01:17:35.000 --> 01:17:43.160
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pagdating naman sa congestion, kung ang isang node ay masusupplyan sana ng generator na nandito sa kabilang node,

asr-001019
01:17:43.680 --> 01:17:48.940
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: pero ang linya ay congested na, umabot na doon sa line limit na yan,

asr-001020
01:17:49.560 --> 01:17:57.960
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ibig sabihin kahit pa ito sana ang pinakamurang generator, para masupplyan yung pangangailangan ng customer na ito,

asr-001021
01:17:58.640 --> 01:18:11.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: kailangan ng mayroong isang generator pa na nakakonekta sa kabilang linya na mag-generate kung anong megawatt yung hindi maitawid dito sa linya na ito.

asr-001022
01:18:11.900 --> 01:18:14.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito naman po ang tinatawag na congestion cost.

asr-001023
01:18:14.940 --> 01:18:19.080
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ngayon po, kada node, iba-iba ang nagiging LMP.

asr-001024
01:18:20.000 --> 01:18:23.560
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Nagkakaroon ng malaking pagkakaiba.

asr-001025
01:18:24.120 --> 01:18:28.080
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Normally, maliit lang naman ang variance ng ating mga...

asr-001026
01:18:28.640 --> 01:18:29.920
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: LMPs.

asr-001027
01:18:30.320 --> 01:18:35.940
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero ang napansin po namin, sa tuwing nagkakaroon ng binding constraint,

asr-001028
01:18:36.600 --> 01:18:44.260
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: kasi po, hindi naman lahat ng generation na kailangan ng Visayas ay nage-generate sa Visayas.

asr-001029
01:18:44.260 --> 01:18:54.000
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Mayroon po siyang kinukuha mula sa Mindanao at ito ay dumadaloy doon sa interconnection ng Visayas at Mindanao.

asr-001030
01:18:54.360 --> 01:18:57.760
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ngayon po, may limitasyon ang pwedeng tumawid ng megawatts doon.

asr-001031
01:18:58.640 --> 01:19:07.900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya sa tuwing ang pangangailangan ng Visayas ay napakalaki at hindi na ito kayang maitawid doon sa 450 na yan,

asr-001032
01:19:08.740 --> 01:19:12.020
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ang yung ating market management system, yung MDOM na yan,

asr-001033
01:19:12.420 --> 01:19:18.900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ang ginawa niya, naglalabas siya ng magkaibang SMP or system marginal price.

asr-001034
01:19:19.360 --> 01:19:26.280
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Iba ang system marginal price doon sa Mindanao, iba ang nagiging system marginal price sa Visayas.

asr-001035
01:19:26.280 --> 01:19:28.280
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Mas mababa ang sa Mindanao.

asr-001036
01:19:28.640 --> 01:19:31.220
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kasi mas mababa yung marginal plant doon.

asr-001037
01:19:31.680 --> 01:19:41.440
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dito sa Visayas, mas mataas kasi nga, mas mahal yung planta, yung marginal plant na kakailanganin para masupply yung demand sa Visayas.

asr-001038
01:19:42.320 --> 01:19:50.900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dahil nagkakaiba yung system marginal price, nagiging malaki ang difference ng kanilang LMP.

asr-001039
01:19:51.080 --> 01:19:58.180
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Remember, ang SMP kung isa lang yan across all the nodes, maliit lang ang variance dahil manggagaling lang yan.

asr-001040
01:19:58.640 --> 01:20:00.580
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At saka sa congestion cost.

asr-001041
01:20:01.020 --> 01:20:08.960
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ngayong nagkaroon ng SMP na iba sa Mindanao, mas mababa at mas mataas doon sa SMP ng Visayas,

asr-001042
01:20:09.600 --> 01:20:16.780
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: yung mga distribution utilities natin, sila yung mga customers, halimbawa sila yung nakakonekta sa node sa Visayas.

asr-001043
01:20:17.360 --> 01:20:22.640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kung meron silang kontrata sa isang generation company na nasa Mindanao,

asr-001044
01:20:23.680 --> 01:20:28.640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: karaniwan sana mababa yung makukuha nilang kontrata.

asr-001045
01:20:28.640 --> 01:20:33.920
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kung meron silang kuryente, batay na rin doon sa kanilang kontrata with that generation company.

asr-001046
01:20:34.440 --> 01:20:39.640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya lang, since hindi makapagpatawid ng kuryente yung galing Mindanao,

asr-001047
01:20:41.140 --> 01:20:50.740
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: yung pangangailangan ng distribution utility na yan sa Visayas ay manggagaling sa isang planta na mas mahal na manggagaling sa Visayas.

asr-001048
01:20:50.740 --> 01:20:57.640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya, ang exposure niya nangyayari, meron siyang exposure sa WSM dahil in effect,

asr-001049
01:20:58.640 --> 01:21:03.620
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: meron siyang kuryente na yan sa Visayas at mas mahal ang LMP sa Visayas.

asr-001050
01:21:04.040 --> 01:21:09.280
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ngayon po, paano nagkakaroon ng spike sa line rental?

asr-001051
01:21:09.560 --> 01:21:20.840
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Meron po kasing formularyo ang line rental at ito po ay nakadepende doon sa difference ng LMP ng seller o ng generator,

asr-001052
01:21:20.840 --> 01:21:27.840
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: yung nasa Mindanao, kasi kung ang generator ay nasa Mindanao, at yung LMP ng customer sa Visayas.

asr-001053
01:21:28.640 --> 01:21:34.500
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang ito po ay malaki, malaki rin po ang nakakalculate na line rental.

asr-001054
01:21:34.980 --> 01:21:39.440
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero, wala pong mali doon, wala pong overcharge doon.

asr-001055
01:21:39.720 --> 01:21:46.100
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang nangyayari lang po sa ating price determination methodology na umiiral sa WSM,

asr-001056
01:21:46.100 --> 01:21:56.340
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ang nakokolektang amount mula doon sa customer na nasa Visayas, dahil nakabasingado sa LMP niya sa Visayas,

asr-001057
01:21:56.720 --> 01:21:58.480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: mas malaki yung trading amount.

asr-001058
01:21:58.640 --> 01:22:05.740
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang nakokolekta from the customers dito sa Visayas, mas malaki kaysa doon sa dapat sanang ibayad sa mga generator.

asr-001059
01:22:06.380 --> 01:22:10.940
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dahil ang kanila namang nodal price, yung LMP nila ay nasa Mindanao.

asr-001060
01:22:10.940 --> 01:22:18.900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang pagbalansi sana yan, para mabawi nung na-expose sa mataas na line rental,

asr-001061
01:22:19.320 --> 01:22:27.960
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: kung magkakaroon ng mataas din na net settlement surplus, dapat ay ang distribution nito, ang allocation nito,

asr-001062
01:22:28.640 --> 01:22:39.380
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: yung formulari yung approved ng ERC, dapat ang allocation yan ay mas malaki doon sa mas malaki ang binayad dahil doon sa congestion.

asr-001063
01:22:39.380 --> 01:22:45.440
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang nakita po nating diferensya, dahil nga po yung market management system, yung makina,

asr-001064
01:22:46.060 --> 01:22:55.380
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ay naglabas ng presyo na malaki ang variance ng LMPs at nagkaroon ng dalawang SMP yung magkabila.

asr-001065
01:22:57.420 --> 01:22:58.380
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pagdating po, ipagkakaroon.

asr-001066
01:22:58.640 --> 01:23:05.500
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ipapasok ngayon itong data na ito, ipapasok po yan doon sa isang sistema pa na ginagamit ng ating market.

asr-001067
01:23:05.500 --> 01:23:11.500
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito naman yung tinatawag na CRSS, yung Central Registration Settlement System.

asr-001068
01:23:12.360 --> 01:23:27.400
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dito po, papasok sana yung datos na yun galing sa MMS at dito sa CRSS, kukomputin niya rin niya automatically yung lalabas na net settlement allocation.

asr-001069
01:23:27.400 --> 01:23:28.620
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kaya lang po.

asr-001070
01:23:28.640 --> 01:23:35.380
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Magalita, Mr. Chair. I understand the technical explanation but my question is very simple.

asr-001071
01:23:36.360 --> 01:23:43.780
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Paano niyo sisiguruduhin na hindi na po mauulit ito at paano rin may babalik yung dapat ibalik na refund?

asr-001072
01:23:44.080 --> 01:23:50.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: At sir, in layman's term, marami po kasing hindi, technically, hindi naiintindihan.

asr-001073
01:23:50.220 --> 01:23:56.060
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Naglabas po kami ng order noong August 13, 2026.

asr-001074
01:23:56.760 --> 01:23:58.000
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Una ay interim.

asr-001075
01:23:58.640 --> 01:24:00.420
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Muna yung pangungulekta ng line rental.

asr-001076
01:24:00.420 --> 01:24:07.020
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kung ano ang magiging shortfall doon sa trading amount ng mga generators, i-allocate siyang kolektahin mula doon sa mga customers.

asr-001077
01:24:07.560 --> 01:24:16.200
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Second, ang longer term solution is gumawa ng isang sistema, ang IMOP, ang market operator,

asr-001078
01:24:16.360 --> 01:24:20.680
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: nagsaganon kung ano yung datos na papasok sa CRSS.

asr-001079
01:24:21.260 --> 01:24:27.580
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito ay nakabatay na doon sa kung ano talaga dapat ang line loss at saka ang congestion cost.

asr-001080
01:24:27.580 --> 01:24:28.460
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: As if.

asr-001081
01:24:28.640 --> 01:24:35.620
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Iisa lang yung naging SMP nila noong dalawang nodes para nagsaganon tama ang maging alokasyon.

asr-001082
01:24:35.920 --> 01:24:49.960
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito po ang gagawin ngayon ng IMOP at yung mga nakaraang panahon na nagkaroon ng tingin namin ng hindi patas na pagbabalik noong net settlement surplus allocation.

asr-001083
01:24:49.960 --> 01:24:58.160
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito po ay pinag-utos namin sa IMOP na ipa-audit sa isang third party.

asr-001084
01:24:58.640 --> 01:25:05.720
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Nagsaganon makita natin yung extent kung merong dapat na mga distribution utilities, lalo na doon sa Visayas,

asr-001085
01:25:05.820 --> 01:25:13.120
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: na mas mataas ang kanilang naibayad na line rental pero maliit ang balik sa kanila, nagsaganon ay maibalik sa kanila yan.

asr-001086
01:25:13.520 --> 01:25:15.960
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you, Mr. Chair. I have no more questions.

asr-001087
01:25:15.960 --> 01:25:26.820
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: May I just end by, first of all, kailangan na kailangan po dapat ma-report nyo sa amin ulit yung mangyayari dito sa WSM refund.

asr-001088
01:25:27.360 --> 01:25:28.140
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Asahan natin.

asr-001089
01:25:28.640 --> 01:25:30.060
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Ito ay aksyonan agad.

asr-001090
01:25:30.560 --> 01:25:48.480
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Pangalawa yung ating VAT, 12% VAT sa systems loss at yung mismong pagtanggal ng systems loss, we will eagerly await that as well as the blacklisting of the Solar Philippines and other actions to be taken para naman sa ating renewable energy.

asr-001091
01:25:48.620 --> 01:25:49.740
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you so much, Mr. Chair.

asr-001092
01:25:49.740 --> 01:25:51.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Kong Chell.

asr-001093
01:25:52.100 --> 01:25:57.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, Chair, ERC, would you like to respond regarding the...

asr-001094
01:25:58.640 --> 01:26:03.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: target dun sa billing for the systems loss? Kung kailan yung target nyo?

asr-001095
01:26:05.600 --> 01:26:19.640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang target po natin is kung September malabas na yung sa BIR din at maging effective siya, lalabas naman po namin yung direktiba namin sa distribution utilities para baguhin yung kanilang bill format.

asr-001096
01:26:19.640 --> 01:26:27.060
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: May mga iba pa pong implementation issues na nakikita natin pagdating sa removal ng VAT.

asr-001097
01:26:27.400 --> 01:26:27.640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dahil po...

asr-001098
01:26:28.640 --> 01:26:45.180
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang system loss na ma-recover ng distribution utilities sa pamamagitan ng pagpataw ng kanilang system loss charge, ito ay malalaman lamang after the fact na after na makapag-bill na yung generator sa distribution utilities.

asr-001099
01:26:45.180 --> 01:26:58.480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So, atin na itong ni-raise as an issue sa BIR and hopefully ma-address ito ng BIR kasi ayaw naman din po natin na magkakaroon po ng sitwasyon na mapagbabayad muna yung...

asr-001100
01:26:58.480 --> 01:27:07.080
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At tapos ay ma-re-refund o i-cocollectahin nila mula sa BIR.

asr-001101
01:27:07.080 --> 01:27:14.240
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang nakikita po nating maaaring implementasyon nito ay kung ang mga distribution utilities,

asr-001102
01:27:14.480 --> 01:27:24.240
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: i-collect lang sila ng VAT corresponding doon sa kanilang energy purchases, katumbas doon sa makocollecta nila at yun ang i-re-remit nila.

asr-001103
01:27:24.700 --> 01:27:28.080
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At to follow, kung ano yung magiging corresponding na system loss,

asr-001104
01:27:28.480 --> 01:27:36.200
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: na amount na hindi naman makakasama na at i-reconcile na lang after that month.

asr-001105
01:27:36.620 --> 01:27:42.620
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So, ito po ay mga implementation issues and tayo naman po ay nakikipag-usap sa BIR.

asr-001106
01:27:42.780 --> 01:27:47.360
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Nang sa ganon, ay maisagawa na itong pagtatanggal ng VAT sa lalong madaling panahon.

asr-001107
01:27:47.520 --> 01:27:53.880
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Hopefully, after September, kung October, meron na po yan. At the earliest is November po ang implementation.

asr-001108
01:27:54.500 --> 01:27:55.520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Chair.

asr-001109
01:27:56.040 --> 01:27:58.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, dyan nyo po makikita na action man po.

asr-001110
01:27:58.480 --> 01:28:05.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, ito po ang ERC ngayon. That's why I'm very supportive doon sa dagdag nyong budget na 200 million.

asr-001111
01:28:05.960 --> 01:28:12.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ano, ang laki po ng binabantayan po nila, ang daming ginagawa, may systems loss pa, very highly technical.

asr-001112
01:28:12.940 --> 01:28:17.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, we need to support ERC. So, November, inaasahan po namin yun.

asr-001113
01:28:18.240 --> 01:28:22.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dahil 19th Congress pa, pinaglalaban na po yan ni Congressman Dagooc.

asr-001114
01:28:23.120 --> 01:28:27.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ngayon po, mangyayari na Congressman Dagooc yung ipinaglalaban natin noon pa.

asr-001115
01:28:27.140 --> 01:28:28.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, congratulations.

asr-001116
01:28:28.480 --> 01:28:36.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, next, to interpelate, ang pinakamagaling pong Congressman sa Camarineson, Congressman Nelson Negacion.

asr-001117
01:28:37.420 --> 01:28:37.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: You have the floor.

asr-001118
01:28:39.880 --> 01:28:49.980
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: Salamat po, Mr. Chairman. Magandang umaga po sa DOE family, headed by Secretary Sharon Garin.

asr-001119
01:28:49.980 --> 01:28:57.980
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: I will be talking about electric cooperatives, especially...

asr-001120
01:28:58.480 --> 01:29:00.360
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: ...its franchises.

asr-001121
01:29:00.760 --> 01:29:11.140
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: It is a matter of record and almost public knowledge na yung prangkesa ng mga electric cooperatives ay mag-e-expire na.

asr-001122
01:29:12.220 --> 01:29:16.700
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: Either this coming 2028 or 2029.

asr-001123
01:29:17.700 --> 01:29:21.720
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: Pero, syempre, exempted doon yung Casureco 4.

asr-001124
01:29:22.120 --> 01:29:28.220
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: Kasi yung Casureco 4, magaling po yung Congressman doon sa 4th District.

asr-001125
01:29:28.480 --> 01:29:38.240
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: As early as last Congress, nakapagpa-approve na po siya ng prangkesa for another 25 years.

asr-001126
01:29:38.420 --> 01:29:42.560
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: Kaya, mas magaling po talaga yun, si Congressman Arne Puentebella.

asr-001127
01:29:45.190 --> 01:29:45.430
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: Okay.

asr-001128
01:29:46.270 --> 01:29:56.690
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: My question can be answered by the Secretary herself, or if you want po, pwede niyo pong ipasa sa ating NEA Administrator.

asr-001129
01:29:56.690 --> 01:29:59.690
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: Would you agree with me that...

asr-001130
01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:05.825
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: Would you agree with me that the grant of franchise by Congress is indispensable?

asr-001130-split-2
01:30:05.825 --> 01:30:11.650
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Mr. Chair, if Admin Nani can answer.

asr-001131
01:30:15.250 --> 01:30:21.650
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: good good afternoon mr chair yes i would agree with the congressman ligation that the grant of

asr-001132
01:30:21.650 --> 01:30:32.290
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: franchise is indispensable uh that would mean that without the the franchise electric cooperatives

asr-001133
01:30:32.290 --> 01:30:39.730
Rep. Nelson S. Legacion: or distribution utilities cannot do business it cannot operate it cannot distribute power

asr-001134
01:30:40.530 --> 01:30:42.130
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: yes i agree uh mr chair

asr-001135
01:30:56.770 --> 01:31:02.050
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: however there are extreme conditions or extreme situations that

