01:59:40.520 --> 01:59:41.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: methodology

asr-001937
01:59:41.520 --> 01:59:42.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: that was

asr-001938
01:59:42.520 --> 01:59:43.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: previously

asr-001939
01:59:43.520 --> 01:59:44.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: being employed

asr-001940
01:59:44.520 --> 01:59:45.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: under

asr-001941
01:59:45.520 --> 01:59:46.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ERP

asr-001942
01:59:46.520 --> 01:59:47.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: and

asr-001943
01:59:47.520 --> 01:59:48.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: at the start

asr-001944
01:59:48.520 --> 01:59:49.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: of the

asr-001945
01:59:49.520 --> 01:59:51.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: IPIRA

asr-001946
01:59:51.520 --> 01:59:52.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: implementation

asr-001947
01:59:52.520 --> 01:59:53.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: in 2001

asr-001948
01:59:53.520 --> 01:59:54.480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Hawk

asr-001949
01:59:54.480 --> 01:59:55.360
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: po

asr-001950
01:59:55.360 --> 01:59:56.360
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: nung-shift

asr-001951
01:59:56.360 --> 01:59:57.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: sa performance-based

asr-001952
01:59:57.520 --> 01:59:58.480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: rake setting

asr-001953
01:59:58.480 --> 01:59:59.480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: methodology

asr-001954
01:59:59.480 --> 02:00:00.520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: as allowed

asr-001958
02:00:00.000 --> 02:00:09.260
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: under Section 43 of EPIRA was made possible through the issuance of the RDWR and RTWR.

asr-001959
02:00:09.880 --> 02:00:20.320
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ano po itong performance-based and how does this consider yung recovery ng just and reasonable cost ng ating mga distribution utilities?

asr-001960
02:00:20.320 --> 02:00:32.300
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito pong performance-based regulation ay isang forward-looking na methodology unlike RORB na nakabase sa historical cost or historical test here.

asr-001961
02:00:32.980 --> 02:00:41.640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dahil po ito ay forward-looking, ito naman po may mga built-in na mga incentive mechanisms sa ganitong metodolohiya.

asr-001962
02:00:41.640 --> 02:00:47.660
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Bakit po? Ang pag-determine na po ng revenue requirement under performance-based regulation,

asr-001963
02:00:47.960 --> 02:00:49.880
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: kapareho rin naman po ang component niyan.

asr-001964
02:00:49.880 --> 02:00:52.800
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Tulad nung sa revenue requirement ng RORB.

asr-001965
02:00:53.320 --> 02:00:55.260
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Titingnan po yung kanilang OPEX.

asr-001966
02:00:55.360 --> 02:00:56.660
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito po yung mga building blocks.

asr-001967
02:00:56.860 --> 02:01:07.100
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: OPEX, return on rate base, return off rate base, at saka yung other taxes.

asr-001968
02:01:07.100 --> 02:01:11.820
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yung pong pagtatakda ng revenue requirement using forecast.

asr-001969
02:01:12.080 --> 02:01:17.100
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito po yung forecast na base doon sa efficient operating expenses,

asr-001970
02:01:17.100 --> 02:01:26.440
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: at saka yung rate base niya, yung nakalipas na ng mga na-procure niya na assets,

asr-001971
02:01:26.580 --> 02:01:37.100
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: and at the same time, yung mga ipoprocure pa niya through CAPEX during the regulatory period of either 4 years or 5 years in the case of NGCP.

asr-001972
02:01:38.140 --> 02:01:43.480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: For distribution utilities, ang nangyayari po during a rate reset exercise,

asr-001973
02:01:43.480 --> 02:01:46.480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ay tinitingnan po yung nararapat na OPEX.

asr-001974
02:01:47.100 --> 02:01:55.500
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At saka kung ano yung magiging value na gagamitin para sa regulatory asset base, yung regulated entity.

asr-001975
02:01:55.940 --> 02:02:01.420
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito pong regulatory asset base will consist of yung roll forward na assets.

asr-001976
02:02:01.560 --> 02:02:05.640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito po yung nanggaling na yung dati pang mga assets na i-roll forward.

asr-001977
02:02:06.200 --> 02:02:14.960
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kasama na rin po dito yung mga CAPEX and other assets na na-procure prior to the rate reset.

asr-001978
02:02:15.580 --> 02:02:16.680
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pagkatapos po noon,

asr-001979
02:02:17.100 --> 02:02:25.080
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ay de-determine na kung ano yung magiging value ng return on rate base at saka return off rate base.

asr-001980
02:02:25.360 --> 02:02:25.900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Mr. Chair,

asr-001981
02:02:26.060 --> 02:02:26.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: bakit po mag...

asr-001982
02:02:26.880 --> 02:02:34.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ilan pong countries ang gumagamit pa nung ganyang sistema?

asr-001983
02:02:36.580 --> 02:02:39.540
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Sa bilang po, wala po akong isaktong datos.

asr-001984
02:02:39.780 --> 02:02:42.900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero po, ang sapagkakalam ko, nung ito po ay inaaral,

asr-001985
02:02:43.360 --> 02:02:45.580
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ang mga ibang jurisdiction na gumagamit nito will include...

asr-001986
02:02:47.100 --> 02:02:52.680
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: UK, Australia, New Zealand.

asr-001987
02:02:53.080 --> 02:02:56.720
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So dito nga po talaga nakapattern yung ating PBR.

asr-001988
02:02:57.220 --> 02:03:00.340
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kailan po ba nagbago yung from RORB?

asr-001989
02:03:02.180 --> 02:03:08.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi ang kaya ko po tinatanong, hindi po ba dapat yung utility, lalo na pag private,

asr-001990
02:03:08.960 --> 02:03:15.240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: dapat sila ang nagpo-put up ng capital at saka yung investment bago nila i-recover sa mga consumers?

asr-001991
02:03:16.140 --> 02:03:17.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Opo, tama po yan.

asr-001992
02:03:17.100 --> 02:03:21.300
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya nga din po, sa ating PBR ngayon,

asr-001993
02:03:21.880 --> 02:03:24.160
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ang kanila pong CAPEX,

asr-001994
02:03:24.660 --> 02:03:29.840
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: pag na ito ay napasama doon sa kanilang rate reset na aprobahan,

asr-001995
02:03:30.420 --> 02:03:31.820
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: yung pong kanilang return,

asr-001996
02:03:32.700 --> 02:03:33.820
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: yung kanilang recovery,

asr-001997
02:03:34.220 --> 02:03:38.300
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: hindi po nakabatay doon sa kabuang halaga nung CAPEX na yan.

asr-001998
02:03:38.780 --> 02:03:41.720
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito pong kanilang ika-CAPEX na,

asr-001999
02:03:41.720 --> 02:03:46.420
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: magpo-procure sila ng linya o ng transformer,

asr-002000
02:03:47.100 --> 02:03:52.760
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: yung pong halaga na yun, kung papasok yan doon sa regulatory period na yan in the form of CAPEX,

asr-002001
02:03:52.900 --> 02:03:55.680
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: maitatayo yan, ang kikitain lang po noon,

asr-002002
02:03:55.760 --> 02:03:59.960
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: hindi po yung makukolekta po as part of the revenue requirement,

asr-002003
02:04:00.140 --> 02:04:02.220
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: is not the entire value of that CAPEX,

asr-002004
02:04:02.560 --> 02:04:10.060
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: but it will be the value of that asset at yung return yan will depend on the WAC that will be approved

asr-002005
02:04:10.060 --> 02:04:15.300
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: o yung weighted average cost of capital para doon sa return on rate base

asr-002006
02:04:15.300 --> 02:04:16.920
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: at saka yung kaukulang.

asr-002007
02:04:16.920 --> 02:04:22.040
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At yung depreciation na yan, recoverable yan over the life of the asset.

asr-002008
02:04:22.640 --> 02:04:27.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Paano kung mangyayari if the project is delayed or hindi nagawa?

asr-002009
02:04:28.440 --> 02:04:34.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Meron na po bang sitwasyon na nakasingil based dito sa current na sistema,

asr-002010
02:04:34.580 --> 02:04:37.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: tapos na-delay o hindi nagawa yung project?

asr-002011
02:04:37.740 --> 02:04:42.140
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dito po pumapasok yung kahalagahan ng rate reset exercise.

asr-002012
02:04:43.080 --> 02:04:46.900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: After every regulatory period of 4 years or 5 years,

asr-002013
02:04:46.920 --> 02:04:51.660
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: pinakailangan on the final year, magkakaroon ng rate reset.

asr-002014
02:04:52.000 --> 02:04:54.120
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ano po yung purpose ng rate reset na yan?

asr-002015
02:04:54.500 --> 02:04:57.620
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Para magkwentahan, magkakaroon ng kwentas-klaras,

asr-002016
02:04:58.000 --> 02:05:00.820
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ikaw ba utility, nagawa mo ba yung CAPEX mo?

asr-002017
02:05:01.220 --> 02:05:06.300
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: E meron lang doon sa iyong taripa, nakasama doon yung return on at saka return off.

asr-002018
02:05:06.620 --> 02:05:10.060
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kung hindi mo nagawa yan, dito po sa susunod na rate reset,

asr-002019
02:05:10.420 --> 02:05:11.900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: yan po ngayon ipo-flowback.

asr-002020
02:05:12.140 --> 02:05:16.900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Mangyayari po, meron kang CAPEX na delay ka,

asr-002021
02:05:16.920 --> 02:05:19.960
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: o hindi mo nagawa, dito sa susunod na rate reset,

asr-002022
02:05:20.280 --> 02:05:22.660
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ito ay ibabawa sa inyong revenue requirement.

asr-002023
02:05:22.840 --> 02:05:26.280
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Meron ka pang penalty, meron ka pang interest na dapat bayaran doon.

asr-002024
02:05:26.800 --> 02:05:30.620
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito lang po ang hindi nangyari dahil sa loob ng mahigit isang dekada,

asr-002025
02:05:31.000 --> 02:05:36.820
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ang ERC noon, hindi nakapag-reset ng taripa ng ating mga private distribution utilities.

asr-002026
02:05:37.260 --> 02:05:40.160
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At ngayong taon lang po natin ito sinasagawa,

asr-002027
02:05:40.620 --> 02:05:43.380
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: at nagkaroon na nga po ang pagdedesisyon ng ERC,

asr-002028
02:05:43.380 --> 02:05:46.200
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: sa loob ng mahigit isang dekada,

asr-002029
02:05:46.920 --> 02:05:51.060
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: una-unahang rate reset sa isang ating private distribution utilities.

asr-002030
02:05:51.320 --> 02:05:55.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, Mr. Chair, marami po tayong nakita na mga ganong sitwasyon

asr-002031
02:05:55.540 --> 02:06:00.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: na nasinil na po sa consumers yung CAPEX para doon sa proyekto.

asr-002032
02:06:00.760 --> 02:06:02.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pero hindi po tayo nakapag-rate reset. Tama po ba?

asr-002033
02:06:05.130 --> 02:06:07.230
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang nangyari po, dahil nga po,

asr-002034
02:06:07.730 --> 02:06:13.350
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ngayong taon lang talaga nagsimula ulit ang rate reset ng ating mga private distribution utilities,

asr-002035
02:06:13.630 --> 02:06:15.350
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ngayon lang din po natin tinitingnan,

asr-002036
02:06:16.330 --> 02:06:17.770
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: dahil in between,

asr-002037
02:06:18.390 --> 02:06:20.990
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: nagkaroon din po sila ng mga CAPEX filings.

asr-002038
02:06:21.150 --> 02:06:25.750
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kasi supposedly, sa rate reset magkakaroon ng approval ng CAPEX program

asr-002039
02:06:25.750 --> 02:06:27.670
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ng ating regulated entity.

asr-002040
02:06:28.210 --> 02:06:30.630
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dahil nga po naantala yung rate reset,

asr-002041
02:06:30.950 --> 02:06:34.930
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: itong mga distribution utilities na kakailangan ng mag-implement ng CAPEX,

asr-002042
02:06:35.230 --> 02:06:40.090
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: nagsipag-file sila ng kanilang mga individual CAPEX filings.

asr-002043
02:06:40.390 --> 02:06:43.870
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At kung na-approbahan at isinagawa nila yung CAPEX project na yan,

asr-002044
02:06:43.870 --> 02:06:48.230
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: sila'y gumastos na, pero hindi sila nagkaroon ng rate adjustment.

asr-002045
02:06:48.390 --> 02:06:50.510
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dahil nga, walang rate reset na nangyari.

asr-002046
02:06:50.850 --> 02:06:52.150
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So ngayong pong taon na ito,

asr-002047
02:06:52.450 --> 02:06:57.630
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: dito sa ating rate reset exercise na ginagawa para sa ating mga private distribution utilities,

asr-002048
02:06:58.110 --> 02:07:03.090
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ating itinatama yung lahat ng nangyaring walang aksyon,

asr-002049
02:07:03.250 --> 02:07:04.150
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: kawalang aksyon,

asr-002050
02:07:04.310 --> 02:07:06.230
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: noong mahigit isang dekada,

asr-002051
02:07:06.630 --> 02:07:08.170
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ngayon po ay itinatama natin.

asr-002052
02:07:08.270 --> 02:07:13.690
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Nagsaganon, ay makasiguro tayo na yung magiging singil ng ating mga distribution utilities

asr-002053
02:07:13.690 --> 02:07:17.050
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ay nararapat lang sa kanilang kaukalong gastos

asr-002054
02:07:17.050 --> 02:07:18.370
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: at kung alo lamang,

asr-002055
02:07:18.390 --> 02:07:19.390
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: yung reasonable.

asr-002056
02:07:19.390 --> 02:07:20.210
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Mr. Chair,

asr-002057
02:07:20.210 --> 02:07:20.710
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Thank you.

asr-002058
02:07:20.710 --> 02:07:21.710
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sa rate reset po ba?

asr-002059
02:07:21.710 --> 02:07:23.710
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Last answer for the last question.

asr-002060
02:07:23.710 --> 02:07:26.710
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tumakbo yata yung oras ko kanina, Mr. Chair.

asr-002061
02:07:26.710 --> 02:07:27.710
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I'll give you another one.

asr-002062
02:07:27.710 --> 02:07:28.210
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Go ahead.

asr-002063
02:07:28.210 --> 02:07:30.210
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Just a short question.

asr-002064
02:07:30.210 --> 02:07:33.210
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sa rate reset po ba, Mr. Chair,

asr-002065
02:07:33.210 --> 02:07:36.210
Rep. Roberto Nazal: kung nasingil po natin sa consumers yan,

asr-002066
02:07:36.210 --> 02:07:38.210
Rep. Roberto Nazal: doon sa rate reset,

asr-002067
02:07:38.210 --> 02:07:40.210
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ibabalik po ba with interest yan?

asr-002068
02:07:40.210 --> 02:07:43.490
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang mangyayari po,

asr-002069
02:07:43.490 --> 02:07:45.490
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: dahil po ito ay ipo-flow back,

asr-002070
02:07:45.490 --> 02:07:49.510
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: doon po sa revenue requirement na itatakda para sa susunod na

asr-002071
02:07:49.510 --> 02:07:51.510
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: regulatory period,

asr-002072
02:07:51.510 --> 02:07:53.510
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ibabawas na yan.

asr-002073
02:07:53.510 --> 02:07:55.510
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So, in effect, ibinabalik na din yan

asr-002074
02:07:55.510 --> 02:07:57.510
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: doon sa susunod na regulatory period po.

asr-002075
02:07:57.510 --> 02:08:00.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, ibabalik din yan sa consumers with interest.

asr-002076
02:08:00.510 --> 02:08:02.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Doon sa ating...

asr-002077
02:08:02.510 --> 02:08:04.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Just a short manifestation.

asr-002078
02:08:04.510 --> 02:08:06.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, Mr. Chair,

asr-002079
02:08:06.510 --> 02:08:08.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: for me, investments are a business risk.

asr-002080
02:08:08.510 --> 02:08:10.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Consumers should pay a fair and reasonable

asr-002081
02:08:10.510 --> 02:08:12.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: return for investments

asr-002082
02:08:12.510 --> 02:08:14.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: actually made and useful to them.

asr-002083
02:08:14.510 --> 02:08:16.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But we should seriously examine

asr-002084
02:08:16.510 --> 02:08:18.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: why consumers should be financing projects

asr-002085
02:08:18.510 --> 02:08:21.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: or financing projected investments in advance.

asr-002086
02:08:21.510 --> 02:08:24.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: If consumers are paying for these investments,

asr-002087
02:08:24.510 --> 02:08:28.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: there must be an independent and transparent mechanism

asr-002088
02:08:28.510 --> 02:08:31.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: to verify that every peso charged

asr-002089
02:08:31.510 --> 02:08:34.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: was actually invested and benefited the consumer.

asr-002090
02:08:34.510 --> 02:08:36.510
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002091
02:08:36.510 --> 02:08:38.510
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you. And I totally agree with you,

asr-002092
02:08:38.510 --> 02:08:40.510
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congressman Nazal. Thank you.

asr-002093
02:08:40.510 --> 02:08:44.510
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, next interpulate is Congressman Leo Rodriguez.

asr-002094
02:08:44.510 --> 02:08:46.510
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002095
02:08:46.510 --> 02:08:48.510
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Thank you, Mr. Chair,

asr-002096
02:08:48.510 --> 02:08:50.510
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: to the DOE family.

asr-002097
02:08:50.510 --> 02:08:52.510
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: May God bless you all.

asr-002098
02:08:52.510 --> 02:08:54.510
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: First of all,

asr-002099
02:08:54.510 --> 02:08:56.510
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: I would like to thank

asr-002100
02:08:56.510 --> 02:08:58.510
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: the DOE through our

asr-002101
02:08:58.510 --> 02:09:00.510
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: leadership of our Secretary

asr-002102
