asr-003904
03:17:32.050 --> 03:17:39.630
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: What is our status now on putting up our own tanks for the government storage?

asr-003905
03:17:39.670 --> 03:17:41.250
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Mr. Chico Alvarez.

asr-003906
03:17:41.430 --> 03:17:42.230
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: Good afternoon, Mr. Chair.

asr-003907
03:17:42.550 --> 03:17:43.150
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: Members.

asr-003908
03:17:43.690 --> 03:17:46.030
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: Yes, next year is our priority project.

asr-003909
03:17:47.030 --> 03:17:51.950
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: We'll start our tank farm on the property of PNOC in Bataan.

asr-003910
03:17:52.470 --> 03:17:58.710
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: So, initially, on phase one next year, we will establish a tank farm worth one million barrels.

asr-003911
03:17:58.710 --> 03:18:00.230
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: But, eventually,

asr-003912
03:18:00.670 --> 03:18:01.710
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: the next phase,

asr-003913
03:18:02.050 --> 03:18:06.770
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: we'll reach 15 million barrels for our tank farm.

asr-003914
03:18:06.770 --> 03:18:07.570
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

asr-003915
03:18:07.570 --> 03:18:09.570
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: PNOC is really good.

