Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Just a follow up on what Press Alvarez said.

asr-003918
03:18:16.370 --> 03:18:21.490
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Are we building a genuine government-owned strategic petroleum reserve or are we simply

asr-003919
