PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: Our first phase will be owned by PNOC.

asr-003921
03:18:28.290 --> 03:18:30.050
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: The first one million barrels.

asr-003922
03:18:30.050 --> 03:18:30.670
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: And then,

asr-003923
03:18:30.690 --> 03:18:31.430
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: the next phase,

asr-003924
03:18:31.430 --> 03:18:41.130
PNOC President and CEO Franz Josef George E. Alvarez: We are open to partnership with other private companies or anyone who wants to join us in a joint venture or invest in us.

asr-003925
03:18:41.630 --> 03:18:43.190
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: No, it's very, very good.

asr-003926
03:18:44.150 --> 03:18:44.710
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Thank you.

