asr-004217
03:32:37.840 --> 03:32:48.620
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Sabi kasi ni Secretary Francisco Laurel na may proposal siya ng geopensing around 3 million hectares of flat agricultural land,

asr-004218
03:32:49.140 --> 03:32:58.060
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: particularly rice-producing areas, to protect prime prime land as the Philippines accelerates its shift toward renewable energy

asr-004219
03:32:58.060 --> 03:33:03.640
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: and prepares for the next Green Energy Auction or tinatawag natin GEA.

asr-004220
