Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Secretary Green, how will the DOE meet its National Renewable Energy Program or tinatawag natin in RIP capacity targets for 2027?

asr-004221
03:33:19.040 --> 03:33:27.960
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Kung ang significant portion ng plant ground mounted solar projects ay nare-restrict due to the Department of Agriculture's geopensing,

asr-004222
03:33:28.060 --> 03:33:29.500
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: ang criteria. Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004223
03:33:29.500 --> 03:33:37.080
