asr-004224
03:33:37.600 --> 03:33:38.820
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004225
03:33:40.200 --> 03:33:48.220
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Yun pong mga solar power plants natin, required po silang magpakita ng proof of possessory rights.

asr-004226
03:33:49.240 --> 03:33:57.560
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Ngayon po, una, bawal magtayo ng solar sa mayroong tubig, irrigation. Bawal po yan.

asr-004227
03:33:58.060 --> 03:34:01.960
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Rice fields po, may irrigation. So, hindi po talaga kasama yan.

asr-004228
03:34:02.760 --> 03:34:12.200
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Sa ngayon po, wala naman po kaming developer na nagsasabi na tatamaan sila noong agri-fencing na gagawin ng Department of Agriculture.

asr-004229
03:34:12.520 --> 03:34:21.400
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: So, hindi po kami nagtatayo ng planta doon sa pwede pong gamitin for productive agricultural activities. Thank you, po.

asr-004230
