asr-004231
03:34:24.620 --> 03:34:25.080
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Okay, sure.

asr-004232
03:34:25.960 --> 03:34:28.000
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Meron din. Tama naman ginagamitin.

asr-004233
03:34:28.060 --> 03:34:32.200
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Ito ang gawa ng DAA. Pero we also go around to the LGUs.

asr-004234
03:34:32.820 --> 03:34:42.160
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Ang pinopropose namin din sa kanila, they can actually issue ordinances na i-limit din nila para hindi affected yung food production nila.

asr-004235
03:34:42.540 --> 03:34:51.500
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: They can do that also on their own. Kasi kahit mabigyan namin yan ng kontrata, dadaan pa rin naman yan sa LGU at kailangan nila ng permit from the LGU.

asr-004236
03:34:52.500 --> 03:34:55.240
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Secretary, for that response.

asr-004237
03:34:55.240 --> 03:35:23.560
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Sa ilalim po kasi ng pinagsamang Farm to Energy Framework, anong bahagi ng allocation, yung allotment nyo ng DOE para sa 2027, ang direktang sumusuporta sa pag-uugnay ng mga suppliers ng renewable energy sa ilalim ng Green Energy Option Program or DOP upang mapababa ang halaga ng karyente para sa patubig, cold storage at mga pasilidad para sa post-harvest.

asr-004238
03:35:23.560 --> 03:35:25.120
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004239
03:35:25.240 --> 03:35:34.900
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Mr. Chair, meron po tayong Green Energy Option, GOP. Meron din po tayong ARCOA, Retail Competition and Open Access.

asr-004240
03:35:35.540 --> 03:35:43.080
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Yung po sa Retail Competition and Open Access, last June 26 po, ibinaba po ng ERC to 100 kilowatts ang threshold.

asr-004241
03:35:43.640 --> 03:35:47.560
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Yung naman pong Green Energy Option, binaba po ng DOE to 50 kilowatts.

asr-004242
03:35:48.380 --> 03:35:53.960
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Ngayon po, pag nasa isang prangkisa lang lahat ng mga under sa Department of Agriculture,

asr-004243
