DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: nilang mag-avail noong tinatawag na Retail Aggregation Program.

asr-004244
03:36:00.120 --> 03:36:06.440
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Pag pinagsama-sama mo sila, aabot na po sila doon sa threshold nitong Retail Competition and Open Access sa CAGIO.

asr-004245
03:36:06.960 --> 03:36:12.160
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Pwede na po silang pumili kung sino po yung magiging supplier nila na renewable energy.

asr-004246
03:36:12.780 --> 03:36:18.920
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: And as nasabi ko po kanina, mas mura po ang renewable kesa sa coal, for example.

asr-004247
03:36:19.420 --> 03:36:21.920
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: So, pwede po mapababa ang presyo ng kuryente nila.

