asr-005039
04:15:48.650 --> 04:15:54.710
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: Of course, the penalty will not come from the DOE, but rather to be endorsed to the Energy Regulatory Commission.

asr-005040
04:15:56.030 --> 04:15:57.650
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: Also, since we recognize...

asr-005041
04:15:58.210 --> 04:16:10.850
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: The difficulties we had in the Visayas, we have identified energy solution and that is providing battery energy storage system in the Visayas.

asr-005042
04:16:10.850 --> 04:16:20.930
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: So, we have identified up to 250 megawatts of battery energy storage that will support the auxiliary requirement for Visayas.

asr-005043
04:16:21.350 --> 04:16:27.830
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: Right now, some 150 megawatts of this 250 are already in place.

asr-005044
04:16:28.210 --> 04:16:30.130
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: And they are being tested at the moment.

asr-005045
04:16:30.370 --> 04:16:33.210
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: Hopefully, it is steering its commissioning.

asr-005046
04:16:34.390 --> 04:16:47.070
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: So, but in the meantime, we are also reviewing the possibilities of adding more auxiliary services for Visayas beyond what is required.

asr-005047
04:16:48.330 --> 04:16:51.450
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: Particularly on the disposable requirement.

asr-005048
04:16:51.450 --> 04:16:56.450
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: Because it happens that the requirement for Visayas...

asr-005049
04:16:58.210 --> 04:17:03.370
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: In extended period has also affected Mindanao.

asr-005050
04:17:03.370 --> 04:17:23.370
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: Then, to support this as a long-term solution, when as mentioned earlier by Secretary Guerin, we are doing a master plan for the Visayas, including distributed energy generation to have each and every island of Visayas the full capacity to generate for itself.

asr-005051
04:17:23.370 --> 04:17:27.370
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: While still interconnected to provide common auxiliaries.

asr-005052
04:17:28.210 --> 04:17:32.390
DOE Undersecretary Mario Marasigan: So, those are the plans that we have for both Visayas and Mindanao.

