05:29:57.160 --> 05:29:57.640
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: by the...

asr-005995
05:29:57.800 --> 05:29:59.700
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: elimination of the non-technical laws

asr-005996
05:29:59.700 --> 05:29:59.980
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: and

asr-005997
05:30:00.000 --> 05:30:05.640
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: so as the technical laws, these are the electric cooperatives.

asr-005998
05:30:06.180 --> 05:30:12.220
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: For the electric cooperatives' mandate is to extend the lines on the unserved and unviable

asr-005999
05:30:12.220 --> 05:30:20.020
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: CTOs, and that will greatly contribute to the systems laws of the electric cooperatives.

asr-006000
05:30:20.120 --> 05:30:29.260
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: However, we are determined to make good pronouncement of the president, but only so far as to the

asr-006001
05:30:29.260 --> 05:30:30.760
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: non-technical systems laws.

asr-006002
05:30:30.920 --> 05:30:34.620
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: We have the energy family through the directive of the secretary.

asr-006003
05:30:34.980 --> 05:30:42.520
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: I believe we have a good plan, a good plan to contain and eventually eliminate the non-technical

asr-006004
05:30:42.520 --> 05:30:43.320
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: systems laws.

