asr-006012
05:31:04.800 --> 05:31:08.520
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: And I have to say that there is so much interest.

asr-006013
05:31:09.380 --> 05:31:16.280
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Marami po talagang gustong mag-invest sa renewable energy in Mindanao because they see the potential.

asr-006014
05:31:16.540 --> 05:31:19.920
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Merong study siya, and then they see it, even hydro.

asr-006015
05:31:20.920 --> 05:31:26.840
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: What we need for Mindanao, even if we have so many power plants there, kung yung electrification

asr-006016
05:31:27.060 --> 05:31:33.260
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: and energization hindi pa rin maayos, baay hindi siya ganun ka-efficient, Mr. Chair.

asr-006017
05:31:33.580 --> 05:31:38.280
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: And that is why I actually asked Nani already to prioritize Mindanao.

asr-006018
05:31:38.280 --> 05:31:46.200
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: But if there's any additional available in the future, then it should be on energization

asr-006019
05:31:46.200 --> 05:31:47.820
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: of Mindanao, Mr. Chair.

asr-006020
05:31:47.880 --> 05:31:49.800
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: And I'm sure you will be supportive of this.

asr-006021
05:31:50.020 --> 05:31:53.180
