NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: The NEP granted us 5 billion and that is the same amount as last year.

asr-006037
05:32:43.920 --> 05:32:47.720
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: That includes the photovoltaic mainstreaming, Mr. Chair.

asr-006038
