NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: I mean, honestly, I'm just more concerned about how to cushion the program implementation

asr-006039
05:32:54.860 --> 05:32:57.820
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: of the elimination of the non-technology service loss.

asr-006040
