asr-006043
05:33:10.220 --> 05:33:15.760
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: and they will not have any source of repayment.

asr-006044
05:33:15.940 --> 05:33:21.400
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: And that would greatly affect their payment schedules on the GENCOs.

asr-006045
05:33:21.440 --> 05:33:22.520
NEA Administrator Antonio Mariano C. Almeda: And we don't want that to happen.

asr-006046
05:33:23.360 --> 05:33:23.980
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-006047
